OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Labour leadership
OL,4,Acontenders back North Sea drilling
OL,5,Aapproval
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe two candidates in the Scottish
OL,8,FLabour leadership race have called for
OL,9,Fnew drilling licences in the North Sea
OL,10,Fto be approved "as soon as possible".
OL,12,FMSPs Joe Fagan and Michael Marra both
OL,13,Fsaid the Rosebank oil and Jackdaw gas
OL,14,Ffields offered cleaner methods of
OL,15,Fextraction than could be relied upon
OL,16,Fabroad, and that approval was vital to
OL,17,Fsupport jobs.
OL,19,FUK Labour ministers are set to make a
OL,20,Fdecision on both projects after
OL,21,Fconsultations closed in recent weeks.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
