OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Labour leadership
OL,4,Acontenders back North Sea drilling
OL,5,Aapproval
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe offshore industry has been lobbying
OL,8,Fhard, stressing the economic and energy
OL,9,Fsecurity benefits, but environmentalist
OL,10,Fargue that more drilling is
OL,11,Fincompatible with efforts to tackle
OL,12,Fclimate change.
